<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id=questions-and-support>Questions and support<a href=#questions-and-support class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Questions and support" title="Direct link to Questions and support">​</a></h2>
<p>If you believe your systems may be affected, contact us immediately:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Security:</strong> <code>security@berri.ai</code></li>
<li><strong>Support:</strong> <code>support@berri.ai</code></li>
<li><strong>Slack:</strong> Reach out to the LiteLLM team directly</li>
</ul>
<p>For real-time updates, follow <a href=https://x.com/LiteLLM target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer">LiteLLM (YC W23) on X</a>.</div></div><aside class=toc_jJZl><div class=tableOfContents_jeP5><div class="tocItemsContainer_yosJ thin-scrollbar"><ul class="table-of-contents table-of-contents__left-border"><li><a href=#tldr class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">TLDR;</a><li><a href=#overview class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Overview</a><li><a href=#confirmed-affected-versions class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Confirmed affected versions</a><li><a href=#what-happened class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">What happened</a><li><a href=#who-is-affected class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Who is affected</a><ul><li><a href=#how-to-check-if-you-are-affected class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">How to check if you are affected</a></ul><li><a href=#indicators-of-compromise-iocs class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Indicators of compromise (IoCs)</a><li><a href=#immediate-actions-for-affected-users class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Immediate actions for affected users</a><ul><li><a href=#1-rotate-all-secrets class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">1. Rotate all secrets</a><li><a href=#2-inspect-your-filesystem class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">2. Inspect your filesystem</a><li><a href=#3-audit-version-history class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">3. Audit version history</a></ul><li><a href=#response-and-remediation class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Response and remediation</a><li><a href=#verify-docker-image-signatures class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Verify Docker image signatures</a><li><a href=#verified-safe-versions class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Verified safe versions</a><li><a href=#questions-and-support class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Questions and support</a></ul></div><div class=promoCard_SGxZ><img src=/img/